den.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/168-aiden","name":"Aiden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-28T15:46:20-07:00","id":495324,"title":"","content":"I remember this series from when I was in elementary school. Of course, my children's media inspiration for an innocents werewolf character would be Eddy from Ed, Edd and Eddy,. The idea of a little Irraka pup scam artist who relies on Cunning and cuteness to get into and out of trouble is too cool to pass up. My head canon is that if an adult werewolf's gauru form is the size of a bear, then an innocents werewolf's gauru form is just a little bigger than the size of a bear cub. I know it's not what the RAW says, but I have an idea for a campaign set in <a href=\"http://www.cracked.com/blog/4-small-towns-with-really-bizarre-claims-to-fame_p2/\" target=\"_blank\">the only town in America where 12 year olds can use the drive skill (on a golf cart)</a> and using a puppy sized gauru form would fit the campaign.<br /> <br /> EDIT: just so you know, Peachtree City is one of those towns that I imagine werewolves with kids would LOVE, lots of forest to hunt in. As for the horror element, the safe suburban image of Peachtree city on the surface is starting to crack, they've been getting a lot of drug crime lately and the police chief shot his wife recently","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":3932,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","user":"The young man in the cafe","date":". 04-28-2015, 06:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-28T15:49:21-07:00","id":495325,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"http://img1.fantasticfiction.co.uk/images/n30/n151810.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> You missed one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-28T15:51:44-07:00","id":495328,"title":"","content":"That's <i>wolfmen</i>, not <i>werewolves</i>. Totally different.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"r